      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Install comfyui-minimax-h3-simple and restart ComfyUI.\n2. Select your installed H3 fl2va model, text encoder and two VAEs in the loaders.\n3. Edit prompt, seconds and chunk_seconds (1\u201314), then Queue. Default: 10 seconds = 5 + 5.\n4. Video with audio is saved under output/video/H3_Simple*.mp4.\n\nOptional: add Load Image and connect IMAGE to first_frame.\nThe node carries 22 frames and audio between chunks; visual continuity is model-dependent.\nRequires current ComfyUI native H3 support. No Easy Media required.\nLoader defaults follow the official ComfyUI MiniMax H3 template:\nhttps://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/main/templates/video_minimax_h3_t2v.json\n\nOutputs: VIDEO, IMAGE (all frames), AUDIO (full soundtrack), LATENT (final chunk including context/padding)."
      ]
    }
